    CmdQuery --> MemMapXML
    TargetXML --> XmlSink
    MemMapXML --> XmlSink
    XmlSink --> PacketEncoder
    TargetXML --> RustFFI
    MemMapXML --> RustFFI

    FreeRTOSEngine --> TCBList
    FreeRTOSEngine --> ThreadIDMap
    FreeRTOSEngine --> CoreContext

    CmdDispatcher --> RustFFI
    MemCache --> RustFFI
    SWBkptMgr --> RustFFI
    FreeRTOSEngine --> RustFFI
    RTTEngine --> RustFFI
    CmdMon --> RustFFI
    CmdRun --> RustFFI
    CmdReg --> RustFFI
    CmdFlash --> RustFFI

    RustFFI --> BMPBridge
    BMPBridge --> TargetEngine
    BMPBridge --> TargetProber
    BMPBridge --> FlashDrivers

    TargetEngine --> CortexM
    TargetEngine --> CortexA
    TargetEngine --> RISCVCore
    TargetEngine --> VendorTargets

    CortexM --> ADIv5
    CortexA --> ADIv5
    RISCVCore --> RISCV_DTM

    ADIv5 --> SWD_Transport
    ADIv5 --> JTAG_Transport
    RISCV_DTM --> RVSWD_Transport
    RISCV_DTM --> SDI_Transport
    RISCV_DTM --> JTAG_Transport

    SWD_Transport --> GPIO_PIO
    RVSWD_Transport --> GPIO_PIO
    SDI_Transport --> GPIO_PIO
    JTAG_Transport --> GPIO_PIO

    GPIO_PIO --> TargetMCU
